title: Hold the Left together
new-page: true

= Hold the Left together

Every organisation at this table believes unity is useful. Each also believes
someone else should pay for it.

- @roundtable
- @local
- @razem
- @labor
- @labor_breakdown
- @progressives
- @social_patriot
- @poland_hub: Spend no action

@roundtable
title: Force a factional roundtable
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Broadly lowers dissent; three-month cooldown.
choose-if: resources >= 1 and roundtable_cooldown = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources, or leaders will not reconvene yet.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.roundtable_cooldown = 3;
Q.party_unity += 5;
for (const faction of Q.factions) {
    Q[faction + "_dissent"] -= 4;
}
Q.news_headline = "The alliance buys another month of peace";
!}

Czarzasty, Biedroń, Zandberg and the parliamentary delegation agree on a common
calendar. Nobody mistakes this for affection, but surprises should be rarer.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@local
title: Rebuild county and municipal structures
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Durable reach, modest polling gain.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; local_network += 7; left_poll += 0.2; barons_strength += 2; barons_dissent -= 3; news_headline = "Local organisers reopen the red map"

The SLD machine knows how to find halls, candidates and old members. Younger
activists notice who controls the membership lists, but the alliance again
exists outside Warsaw.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@razem
title: Negotiate programme guarantees with Razem
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Better cooperation, angrier barons; one-month pause.
choose-if: resources >= 1 and razem_guarantee_cooldown = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources, or the last guarantees have not yet been tested.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; razem_guarantee_cooldown = 2; razem_cooperation += 8; razem_dissent -= 8; party_unity += 2; barons_dissent += 4; labor_credibility += 2; news_headline = "Razem puts milestones in writing"

Housing, health and workplace enforcement become dated commitments rather than
conference language. Old hands object that a junior partner has been given a
veto; Razem replies that this is the first promise it can audit.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@labor
title: Build the Lewica Pracy–union organising table
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Builds trust, workplace power and an enforceable policy channel.
view-if: labor_active = 1 and labor_in_left = 1 and labor_party_formed = 0
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; labor_credibility += 6; union_trust += 8; opzz_cooperation += 7; labor_mobilization += 7; labor_dissent -= 5; labor_reform_progress += 4; left_poll += 0.2; household_policy_pressure += 2; health_policy_pressure += 1; razem_cooperation += 2; razem_dissent -= 2; progressives_dissent -= 2; spring_dissent -= 1; barons_dissent += 1; government_coalition_dissent += 1 if left_in_government = 1; last_policy_stage = "Movement-backed proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Lewica Pracy MPs, OPZZ and wider union organisers"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "A permanent union table gives the social programme workplace power"

Lewica Pracy MPs, including Agnieszka Dziemianowicz-Bąk, convene teachers,
nurses, inspectors, OPZZ and unaffiliated workplace organisers. Nobody is
asked to join a fictional party caucus. The resulting programme is costed,
legible and backed by people able to organise around it.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@labor_breakdown
title: Expel the labour-first MPs and denounce the union protocol
subtitle: Exceptional and irreversible: only an openly hostile relationship can create an independent labour list.
view-if: labor_relationship_state = "hostile" and labor_active = 1 and labor_in_left = 1 and labor_party_formed = 0 and labor_party_breakdown_authored = 0
on-arrival: labor_party_breakdown_authored = 1; labor_escalation_stage = 7; labor_demand_answered = 1; labor_circle_formed = 1; labor_dissent = 100; union_trust -= 15; opzz_cooperation -= 18; labor_mobilization += 8; party_unity -= 10; public_trust -= 4; workers_support -= 4; barons_dissent -= 3; razem_dissent += 8; progressives_dissent += 6; spring_dissent += 4; government_coalition_dissent += 5 if left_in_government = 1; news_headline = "The leadership expels labour-first MPs and tears up its union protocol"
go-to: poland_caucus_dynamics.router

Lewica's leadership expels Dziemianowicz-Bąk and the other labour-first MPs,
withdraws from its protocol with OPZZ and tells union organisers that workplace
conflict is no longer welcome inside the parliamentary project. Only this
authored institutional rupture—not high dissent, a lost whip or an unfulfilled
concession—can produce an independent labour list.

@progressives
title: Give younger women-led organisers real authority
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Progressive and feminist trust; old-guard backlash.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; progressive_credibility += 7; feminist_trust += 6; progressives_strength += 2; progressives_dissent -= 6; barons_dissent += 5; media_capacity += 2; news_headline = "A new generation claims the front row"

You assign younger progressive figures—not merely the old leadership—to
candidate preparation, reproductive rights and equality messaging. The
photographs change immediately. Control of the party will take longer.

- @poland_hub: Return to the leadership table

@social_patriot
title: Build Lewica Patriotyczna
subtitle: Its own organisers choose between welfare referrals and regional sovereignty.
view-if: social_patriot_active = 1

= Lewica Patriotyczna organises

The new organisation cannot live on the main party's SLD inheritance. It must
turn the material line into people, branches and a recognisable public role.

- @social_patriot_welfare
- @social_patriot_regions
- @poland_hub: Return

@social_patriot_welfare
title: Open a welfare and public-service referral network
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Builds strength among workers and older households.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The referral network needs one organisational resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; social_patriot_strength += 2; social_patriot_dissent -= 3; social_patriot_referrals += 4; workers_support += 2; public_sector_support += 2; pensioner_support += 2; news_headline = "Lewica Patriotyczna opens its own welfare referral network"
go-to: poland_hub

@social_patriot_regions
title: Convene regional development assemblies
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Builds local organisation and rural reach.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The assemblies need one organisational resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; month_actions += 1; social_patriot_local_organisation += 5; social_patriot_cohesion += 3; social_patriot_referrals += 2; local_network += 3; rural_support += 3; psl_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Lewica Patriotyczna builds a regional organisation beyond SLD"
go-to: poland_hub
